                    "# 📚 Books Lakehouse Dashboard\n",
                    "\n",
                    "**What this shows** — the Book-Crossing lakehouse, stage by stage. Bronze ingests the raw CSVs, silver validates each row (bad rows are quarantined, not dropped), and gold joins validated books with their rating stats via a metric view.<br>**How to use it** — slice every widget with the filters above: publication period (default 1995–2004), author, publisher, and country. The rankings average explicit ratings (1–10 scale, implicit 0 ratings excluded, books with ≥100 explicit ratings only); the user tables list the 10 most active raters and the 10 “highest buyers” (all ratings incl. implicit); and the bottom bar charts show how many rows survive each pipeline layer."
                  ],
